\* All TLC check configs for AntflyTableLifecycle.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyTableLifecycle.tla.

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDesiredRangeWithoutTable = FALSE
    BuggyPlanIntentUndesiredRange = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    DesiredRangesHaveTable
    NoIntentPlannedForUndesiredRange
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    TopologyEventuallyConverges

==== BadIntentUndesiredRange
\* Expected-failure config: the planner creates a placement intent for a
\* committed range that the desired topology no longer contains (revives a
\* dropped table's group). Pinned to the planner-scope invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDesiredRangeWithoutTable = FALSE
    BuggyPlanIntentUndesiredRange = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoIntentPlannedForUndesiredRange

==== BadRangeWithoutTable
\* Expected-failure config: a desired range is admitted without its table
\* (table_manager.zig:350 UnknownTable guard removed). Pinned to the
\* desired-topology integrity invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyDesiredRangeWithoutTable = TRUE
    BuggyPlanIntentUndesiredRange = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    DesiredRangesHaveTable
